oken = time.time()`.\n           - If `len(current_text) > len(prev_text)`: `t_last_growth = time.time()`, yield delta, reset stability counter.\n           - If `len(current_text) == len(prev_text)` and `not is_running` and `len(current_text) > 0`:\n             - If stable for `stability_wait` seconds $\\rightarrow$ `state = \"RESPONSE_COMPLETED\"`, break.\n           - If `len(current_text) == 0` and `elapsed > first_token_timeout`:\n             - Abort with `\"[Error: FIRST_TOKEN_TIMEOUT - Model stayed in thinking without generating tokens for {first_token_timeout:.0f}s]\"`\n           - If text stagnates without growth for > 90s while `not is_running` $\\rightarrow$ abort.\n     - Log full timing summary:\n       `logger.info(f\"{case_count} cases | first token: {first_token_elapsed:.1f}s | completed: {total_duration:.1f}s | timeout: {max_total_timeout:.0f}s\")`\n2. **Update `src/fast_match/coordinator.py` & `dist_production/src/fast_match/coordinator.py`**:\n   - In `_call_local_api()`:\n     - Pass `headers={\"X-Batch-Size\": str(len(inputs.get(\"cases\", []))), ...}`.\n     - Dynamically set HTTP timeout: `(30, max(300, len(inputs.get(\"cases\", [])) * 5 + 90))`.\n   - In `process_chunk()`:\n     - If error message is `NO_RESPONSE_STARTED` or connection dropped: allow retry.\n     - If error message indicates progress was made or incomplete schema: log error and diagnostic.\n3. **Launch MSEMAX Gateway & Test with a 75-case batch**:\n   - Verify that the 75-case batch is monitored smoothly through thinking, first token, continuous growth, and clean stability completion with timing logs printed.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Must NOT alter any Business Rules, Prompts, or Matching Logic.\n- Must preserve the 75-case chunk size.\n- Must provide explicit timing logs per stage as requested by the user.\n</summary>\n\nYou have the 252 following artifacts written to the artifacts directory:\n\n[ARTIFACT: agent]\nPath: file:///C:/Users/kakak/.gemini/a